<title>UK: British Telecom names Smith Cellnet chief.</title>
<headline>British Telecom names Smith Cellnet chief.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British Telecommunications said on Monday that it had appointed Ray Smith as managing director of its mobile phone business, Cellnet, with immediate effect.</p>
<p>Smith succeeds Howard Ford who quit a fortnight ago.</p>
<p>Cellnet is jointly owned by BT and Securicor Group Plc.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366.</p>
</text>
